    "text": "Her ki\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00feat Aluric se canonica of Execestre alisde Reinold at Herberde & at his cilden &\nAnd Aluric hine clipa\u00f0 freoh & saccles a tune & of tune for godes luue.\nAnd \u00f0is is seo gewitnisse, Iohan alurices sune, & Nicole & Ailric & Randolf, Alword cild, Osbern\nOsbern Hod Pilegrim Ialebriht Gesfrei se coc & Pierres se niulier Ailric, & Gales.\nAnd se \u00fee \u00feis undo, habbe he godes curs & Sanct\u00eb Marie & sanctes Petres & ealle Cristes halgena a\nAmen.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feissere becc \u00fe\u00e6t Rotberd apoldraham cw\u00e6\u00f0 saccles Willelm his bro\u00f0er sune of poldraham\n\u00d0ar to is iwitnis Reinald preost, & Dunnig, & Dalfin, & Seuara, & Sewi, & Girard, & Willelm\nSe \u00f0e \u00feiss eure undo, habbe he Godes curs, & sancta Maria, & ealle Cristes gecorena, a butan ende.\nAmen.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feissere boc \u00fe\u00e6t Oter & his cild cwede saccles Aluric \u00feane Reda, & his ofspring.\nAnd \u00fearto is iwitnis Alword preostes, & Alured preost, & Waltere se canon.\nAnd Theodbald, & Semer Cipspones sune, & Waltere se Flemig, & Gesfrei Hoel, & Randolf se\nAnd Ricard se Flemig nam feor penegas to tolle.\nSe \u00fee \u00feiss mare undo, habbe he Godes curs, & Sancta Maria, and ealle Cristes gecorena, a butan ende.\nAmen.\nHer ki\u00f0 on \u00feissere becc \u00fe\u00e6t Gesfrei Foliot cwe\u00f0 saccles Semer Aluredes m\u00e6g & eall his ofsprig.\nAnd \u00fear to ys iwitnis Ricard se portreua, & Rau Theodbiscop, & Waltere de sune odin, & Willelm\nSe\u00f0e \u00feis undo, habbe he Godes curs, & sancte Marie, & ealle Cristes halgena, a butan ende.\nAmen.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feissere becc \u00fe\u00e6t A\u00f0elicc Ricardes swuster scirreua cw\u00e6\u00f0 Hrodolf Sewies sune an\n\u00d0ar to is iwitnis Ricard se portreua, & Willelm Lambr, Dunnig, Eorlawine, Reiner, Aluric Spoe,\nSe \u00fee \u00feis undo, habbe he Godes curs, & Sancte Marie, & ealle Cristes halgena, a butan ende.\nAmen.\nHer ki\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Waltere Wulwordes sune ureode A\u00feeluue inna Sanctes Petres minstre ouer\nOn Viuienes gewitnisse, & mestre Odo, & mestre Leowines, & Godwines preost, & Edwakeres, & his\nAnd se \u00fee \u00feiss undo habbe he Godes curs & \u00feere hlefdia Sancte Marie & Sanctes Petres & gealle\nAmen.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Gesfr\u00e6g Feala sune gebohte Gidi\u00fe Edwiges docter at Alpsta on Wunforda.\n& at Ne\u00e6le Pynceune to X scillingas freoh & sacles ut of Wunforda.\nAnd Gyldeberd portgerefa nam \u00fe\u00e6t toll far \u00feas kinges hand.\n& \u00f0ys ys seo gewitnisse, Gedm\u00e6r on Cuike, & S\u00e6ger preost on Hefatriwe, & Randolf de Hage, &\nAnd se \u00fee \u00feiss undo, h\u00e6bbe he Godes curs, & Sancta Maria, & Sanctes Petres, & ealle Cristes\nAmen.\nHer ky\u00fe on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Huberd on Clist cr\u00e6fede anne wifman \u00fee Edit hatte Liuegeres wif mid\nAnd ealswa hit hriht w\u00e6s on \u00feam dagum \u00e6lcne freohne man wi\u00fe XXX peningas & Huberd w\u00e6s\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6r to is gewittnis Willelm de Buhuz, & Ruold se cniht, & Osbern Fadera, & Unfreig de\n& \u00feeos sp\u00e6c w\u00e6s innan Willelmes bure de Buhuz on Excestre gesp\u00e6ce.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Willelm de la Brugere cw\u00e6\u00f0 saccles Wulw\u00e6rd \u00f0ane webba, inna tune and\n& \u00fear to is iwitnis, Rau Teodberhtes sune, & Teodberhtes his sune & Atsun se hwita, Hro\u00f0olf Alca\nSe \u00fee \u00feis mare undo habbe he Cristes curs & sancte Maria, & ealle Cristes halgena a butan ende.\nAmen.\nHer ki\u00f0 on \u00feissere becc \u00fe\u00e6t Willelm bisceop of Execestre cw\u00e6\u00f0 Wulfric Pig freoh & saccles of \u00fea\n\u00d0ar to is iwitniss, Algar se bisceop of Constance, & se prior of Plimtune, & se prior of Tantune, & se\nSe \u00fee \u00feis efre undo, habbe he Godes curs, & Sancta Maria, & ealle Cristes gecorena, a butan ende.\nAmen.\nHer cy\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Bruning Cola sunu gebohte Roting \u00e6t Colewyne & \u00e6t Leofa, freoh &\nOn S\u00e6rla gewytnisse \u00fe\u00e6s portgereua, & on Huberdes, & on \u00e6lwerdes, & on \u00e6lgares Paiardes, & on\nAnd hebbe he Godes curs \u00fee \u00feis \u00e6fre undo.\nAmen.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Teolling gebohte \u00e6lword Stamera & Edwine his bro\u00f0or \u00e6t Coluwine to\nAnd \u00e6lword portgerefa nam \u00fe\u00e6t toll.\nAnd her to is gewitnesse Ui\u00f0el \u00e6t Culumtune & S\u00e6wulf & Uitula & Eadmund preost & Snelling\nAnd h\u00e6bbe he Godes curs \u00fee \u00feis \u00e6fre undo a on ecnisse.\nAmen.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Leowine Lundenisca & Ialdgi\u00f0 his wif gebohton \u00e6lfilde \u00e6t Touie to\nAnd \u00e6lfric Hals nam \u00fe\u00e6t toll innan Touies bure for \u00fe\u00e6s kynges hand.\nAnd her to is gewitnesse Ro\u00f0salin preost, & Ailword diacon, & Alwine diacon, & Dunstan Peoning.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Wulword bohte Leouede \u00e6t Hierdinge Eadno\u00f0es sune wi\u00f0 V scillingas to\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t toll nam Garwise gerefa to Toppeshamme.\nOn Smewines gewitnesse preost,es, & on Alwines preost & on Ailwordes \u00e6t Oteri, & on Dunninges\n& se \u00fee \u00feiss undo habbe he Godes curs a butan ende.\nAmen.\nHer ki\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Regenere bohte Alfi\u00f0e at Regenolde \u00feam muneke at Cuicu wi\u00f0 V\nOn Edm\u00e6res gewitnesse preost & on Edwines \u00feas gereua & on Roberdes, & on Agelrices at\nAnd Alfric Hals nam \u00fe\u00e6t toll.\nAnd habbe Godes curs \u00fee hit \u00e6fre undo.\nAmen.\nHer ki\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Sewine Pinca bohte hine silfne to X scillingas at Willelme, on Edm\u00e6res\nAnd Alfric Hals nam \u00fe\u00e6t toll.\nAnd habbe he Godes curs \u00fee hit \u00e6fre undo.\nAmen.\nHer cy\u00f0 on \u00feisse bec \u00fea Osbern biscop halgode Sancta Maria portic.\n\u00dea freode Folcard \u00fe\u00e6r Agelwine his man & his of spring Criste to lofe & Sancta Maria & his sawle\nAnd let him ceosa hlaford loc hw\u00e6r hig wolde, & h\u00e6bbe he Godes curs & ealra halgena \u00fee \u00feis \u00e6fre\nAmen.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Liueger se bacestere on Excestre alysde an wifman Edi\u00fe hatte, Godrices\nAnd Gesfreig bisceop w\u00e6s hlaferd ofer Clist land on \u00feam dagum.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6rto is gewitnis Colswein & Roger on Buin, & Hereberd on Clist, & Edric se cipa.\nAnd se \u00fee \u00feis undo h\u00e6bbe he Godes wr\u00e6\u00f0e a butan ende.\nAmen.\nHer cy\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Huscarl lisde hine silfne wi\u00f0 ealuwb mid XL peningas on Godwines\nAnd Wulfet namon \u00fe\u00e6t toll for \u00feas cinges hand, & for S\u00e6rles \u00fee \u00fea was portigerefa.\nGodes curs he habbe \u00fee hit \u00e6fre undo.\nAmen.\nHer cy\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Leowine Feala sunu bohte hine silfne & his ofspring \u00e6t Wulfworde\nOn Willelmes gewitnesse preostes, & on Godwines preoste & on Arnoldes preost & on Edwines\nAnd Alword portgerefa & Alwine Dirlinges a\u00feum fangon to \u00feam tolle for \u00fe\u00e6s cynges hand.\n& habbe he Godes curs & ealra halgena \u00fee \u00feis \u00e6fre undo.\nHer cy\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t Edi\u00fe Leofrices docter Locces bohte hi silue & hire ofspring at Hul to IIII\nAnd habbe he Godes curs & ealra halgena \u00fee hit \u00e6fre undo.",
